		    Description		    "Add bias, scale factor, and white noise to a signal\n\n- 'on/off': 1 = noise on, 0 = noise off"
		    ".\n- 'sigma' : Standard deviation of white noise.\n- 'seed'  : Random number seed. Generated numbers\n  change b"
		    "etween each simulation run, but the random number \n  sequences do not change between Matlab sessions unless a \n"
		    "  new seed is specified.\n- 'bias'  : Constant mean value offset of white noise.\n- 'scale factor' : Scale facto"
		    "r applied to original signal."
		    Display		    "disp('bias/scf/noise')"
