      "dEast; e.WindDown];\nc = [e.WindNorth, e.WindEast, e.WindDown]*[e.WindNorth; e.WindEast; e.WindDown]- Va^2;\nVg "
      "= -b+sqrt(b^2-c);\n\nRollAngle = atan2(PHeadingAngle*angdiff(HeadingAngle,UHeading)*Vg,e.Gravity*cos(HeadingAngl"
      "e-YawAngle));"
